/* 麦克风权限 */
"Microphone" = "麦克风";
"Not asked yet" = "尚未询问";
"Allow Microphone" = "允许麦克风";
"Clothespeg uses the microphone for one thing: recording a voice memo on a note. The audio stays in a file beside your notes on this Mac and is never uploaded." = "Clothespeg 只用麦克风做一件事：给便签录一段语音。录音文件存在这台 Mac 的便签目录旁边，不会上传。";
